@startuml
title Proxy / Surrogate

skinparam legendBackgroundColor #f9f9f9
skinparam legendBorderColor #999999

legend right

**Intent**:
Placeholder to control access to a real subject.

**Motivation**:
Lazy loading, remote proxies, protection proxies, caching.

**Applicability**:
Control lifecycle or access; remote communication; expensive operations.

**Participants**:
Proxy implements Subject, forwards, adds control logic.

**Consequences**:
Pros: Access control; lazy init; caching; remote transparency.
Cons: More indirection; need to handle failure/retries in remote proxies.

**Implementation Notes**:
Use virtual proxy for lazy initialization; remote proxy for IPC; protection proxy for auth.

**Known Uses**:
Java RMI proxies; Hibernate lazy proxies; java.lang.reflect.Proxy.

**Related Patterns**:
Decorator (adds behavior but not necessarily access control), Adapter.

endlegend

interface Subject {
  +request()
}

class RealSubject
class Proxy {
  -real : RealSubject
  +request()
}

Subject <|.. RealSubject
Subject <|.. Proxy
Proxy o-- RealSubject
@enduml